  (text "x2.2" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 154.94 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "48a6cb90-5e48-5c19-b18b-77a7370a5bc5"))
  (text "Section 8 of the circuit notes. C16 and the 100 kOhm linear Blend pot, its other end tied to the input buffer, as\ntraced [2]; the follower IC1_C gives clean + b HP(driven - clean), modelled exactly. IC1_B: the mixer's x2.2 gain\nis traced [2]; RX3 and RX4 are chosen to give it. RVX4: the Level pot, value chosen. The DSP replaces the mixer\ngain and Level with a Level control in dB, and trims the driven path (drvTrim = 0.32, chosen)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "33f92864-0174-59aa-bd54-e25808df4ff2"))
